# Build context exclusions for docker/server.Dockerfile. BuildKit reads
# <Dockerfile>.dockerignore next to the Dockerfile in preference to a
# .dockerignore at the context root, so this applies to `docker build -f
# docker/server.Dockerfile .` and to the compose build.
.git
.github
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/*.log
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
**/.DS_Store
